[00:00.00] 作词 : DUbaldo, Nowels, Steinberg
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Rick Nowels/Marie Claire D'Ubaldo/Billy Steinberg
[00:13.79]And in your eyes I see ribbons of color
[00:13.79]在你眼中我看见了色彩斑斓
[00:24.38]I see us inside of each other
[00:24.38]我知道我们彼此在对方心里
[00:33.73]I feel my unconscious merge with yours
[00:33.73]我感受到我们心灵的融合
[00:38.94]And I hear a voice say
[00:38.94]我听见一个声音说
[00:42.27]"What's his is hers"
[00:42.27]凡是他的，即是她的
[03:07.68][00:46.19]I'm falling into you
[03:07.68]我爱着你
[03:13.00][00:51.42]This dream could come true
[03:13.00]这个梦会实现
[03:17.47][00:56.36]And it feels so good falling into you
[03:17.47]爱上你的感觉如此美妙
[01:06.32]I was afraid to let you in here
[01:06.32]我甚至害怕你在我心里
[01:15.92]Now I have learned love can't be made in fear
[01:15.92]现在我知道，爱不会在恐惧里存在
[01:25.78]The walls begin to tumble down
[01:25.78]内心的围墙轰然倒塌
[01:31.07]And I can't even see the ground
[01:31.07]我甚至看不见地面
[01:38.18]I'm falling into you
[01:38.18]我深深爱上了你
[01:43.65]This dream could come true
[01:43.65]这个梦会实现
[01:48.08]And it feels so good falling into you
[01:48.08]爱上你的感觉如此美妙
[03:26.62][01:57.33]Falling like a leaf
[03:26.62]像落叶般坠入其中
[03:31.29][02:01.81]Falling like a star
[03:31.29]像星星一样降落
[03:37.85][02:07.93]Finding a belief
[03:37.85]找寻一份信念
[03:42.72][02:13.19]Falling where you are
[03:42.72]降落在你身边
[02:19.57]Catch me, don't let me drop!
[02:19.57]抓住我，不要让我落下！
[02:24.97]Love me, don't ever stop!
[02:24.97]爱我，不要停止爱我！
[02:41.44]
[02:47.84]So close your eyes and let me kiss you
[02:47.84]闭上眼睛，让我吻你吧
[02:57.63]And while you sleep I will miss you
[02:57.63]你睡觉时我都会思念你
[04:01.10][03:56.08][03:51.74]Falling into you
[04:01.10]深深爱着你
